    <main>
      <section id="home" class="hero">
        <div
          class="hero-bg"
          style="background-image: url(&quot;./imgs/full/wedding-14.jpg&quot;)"
        ></div>
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <div class="hero-logo">
            <img src="./imgs/logo-mark.jpg" alt="KGM TLAKS Photography logo" />
          </div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Welcome to KGMTLAKS PTY-LTD</p>
          <h1>Moments worth <span>keeping.</span></h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Weddings, golf days and birthdays &ndash; captured with an eye for
            emotion, detail and the split second in between. Get to know us
            below, then step inside the portfolio.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a href="portfolio.html" class="button solid"
              >Enter the portfolio &rarr;</a
            >
            <a href="about.html" class="button ghost">Our story</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#about" class="scroll-cue" aria-label="Scroll down"
          ><span></span
        ></a>
      </section>

      <section class="stats">
        <div><strong>33</strong><span>Featured photos</span></div>
        <div><strong>3</strong><span>Signature collections</span></div>
        <div><strong>Gauteng</strong><span>Based in South Africa</span></div>
        <div>
          <strong>Colour + B&amp;W</strong><span>Edited to suit the story</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about" class="section">
        <div class="wrap about">
          <div class="about-img">
            <img
              src="./imgs/thumb/wedding-16.jpg"
              alt="Bride in a robe embracing her wedding dress"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <img
              class="small"
              src="./imgs/thumb/golf-10.jpg"
              alt="Hand holding a Callaway golf ball"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="about-text">
            <p class="eyebrow">About the business</p>
            <h2>Hi, we&rsquo;re KGMTLAKS.</h2>
            <p>
              KGMTLAKS PTY-LTD is the photography business of
              <strong>Kgotso George Matlakala</strong> (KGM), based in Gauteng,
              South Africa. Every shoot starts with listening &ndash; to the
              couple, the host or the tournament organiser &ndash; so the final
              gallery feels like <em>their</em> day.
            </p>
            <p>
              We love the big moments, but we are just as drawn to the small
              ones: a ring balanced on a heel, a glove on a driver, the first
              laugh of the morning.
            </p>
            <ul class="ticks">
              <li>Natural, story-led coverage</li>
              <li>Edited in colour and black &amp; white</li>
              <li>Every image delivered with the KGM TLAKS signature</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="about.html" class="button solid">Our story</a>
            <a href="portfolio.html" class="button outline">See our work</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="skills" class="section soft">
        <div class="wrap">
          <header class="section-head reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
            <h2>Skills &amp; services</h2>
            <p>Full-story coverage for the occasions that matter most.</p>
          </header>
          <div class="cards">
            <a class="card reveal" href="weddings.html"
              ><img
                src="./imgs/thumb/wedding-06.jpg"
                alt="Couple sharing a laugh in the garden"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="card-body">
                <span class="num">01</span>
                <h3>Weddings</h3>
                <p>
                  Getting ready, arrivals, couple portraits, rings and décor.
                </p>
                <span class="link">View weddings &rarr;</span>
              </div></a
            ><a class="card reveal" href="golf-days.html"
              ><img
                src="./imgs/thumb/golf-07.jpg"
                alt="Follow-through under a clear blue sky"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="card-body">
                <span class="num">02</span>
                <h3>Golf Days</h3>
                <p>Swings, tee-offs, putting and close-up details.</p>
                <span class="link">View golf days &rarr;</span>
              </div></a
            ><a class="card reveal" href="birthdays.html"
              ><img
                src="./imgs/thumb/birthday-01.jpg"
                alt="Black bead cake topped with red sugar roses and gold leaves"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="card-body">
                <span class="num">03</span>
                <h3>Birthdays</h3>
                <p>Cakes, styled tables and milestone moments.</p>
                <span class="link">View birthdays &rarr;</span>
              </div></a
            >
          </div>
          <ul class="skill-tags">
            <li>Event coverage</li>
            <li>Couple &amp; bridal portraits</li>
            <li>Action &amp; sports photography</li>
            <li>Macro &amp; detail shots</li>
            <li>Décor &amp; table styling</li>
            <li>Candid storytelling</li>
            <li>Black &amp; white editing</li>
            <li>Colour grading &amp; retouching</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="wrap">
          <header class="section-head reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
            <h2>Simple from start to finish</h2>
          </header>
          <ol class="steps">
            <li class="reveal">
              <span>1</span>
              <h3>Tell us about your event</h3>
              <p>Share the date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="reveal">
              <span>2</span>
              <h3>We capture it</h3>
              <p>
                Relaxed, unobtrusive coverage so everyone can enjoy the day.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li class="reveal">
              <span>3</span>
              <h3>You get the story</h3>
              <p>
                Carefully edited photographs in colour and black &amp; white.
              </p>
            </li>
          </ol>
          <div class="enter-banner reveal">
            <div>
              <h2>Ready to see the work?</h2>
              <p>
                Browse the collections &ndash; weddings, golf days and
                birthdays.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a href="portfolio.html" class="button solid"
              >Enter the portfolio &rarr;</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="contact" class="section contact">
        <div class="wrap contact-grid">
          <div class="reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
            <h2>Let&rsquo;s capture your next event.</h2>
            <p>
              Tell us about your date, venue and the kind of coverage you have
              in mind and we&rsquo;ll come back to you with availability and a
              quote.
            </p>
            <ul class="contact-list">
              <li>
                <span>Email</span
                ><a
                  data-mail
                  href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#4b202c263f272a20380b2c262a222765282426"
                  ><span
                    class="__cf_email__"
                    data-cfemail="b4dfd3d9c0d8d5dfc7f4d3d9d5ddd89ad7dbd9"
                    >[email&#160;protected]</span
                  ></a
                >
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>Phone</span>
                <div>
                  <a data-tel href="tel:+27793171152">079 317 1152</a>
                  <em class="sub">Mobile</em><br /><a
                    data-tel2
                    href="tel:+27812471946"
                    >081 247 1946</a
                  >
                </div>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>Messenger</span
                ><a
                  data-messenger
                  href="https://www.facebook.com/messages/t/kgmtlaks/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  >Kgmtlaks PTY - LTD</a
                >
              </li>
              <li><span>Location</span>Gauteng, South Africa</li>
            </ul>
            <div
              class="socials on-light"
              data-social
              aria-label="Social media"
            ></div>
            <a
              class="button msn"
              data-messenger-btn
              href="https://www.facebook.com/messages/t/kgmtlaks/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              >Chat on Messenger</a
            >
          </div>
          <form id="contact-form" novalidate class="reveal">
            <label
              >Your name<input
                type="text"
                name="name"
                required
                autocomplete="name"
            /></label>
            <label
              >Email<input
                type="email"
                name="email"
                required
                autocomplete="email"
            /></label>
            <label
              >Type of event
              <select name="type">
                <option>Wedding</option>
                <option>Golf day / corporate event</option>
                <option>Birthday / celebration</option>
                <option>Other</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label
              >Message<textarea
                name="message"
                rows="4"
                required
                placeholder="Date, venue, anything we should know…"
              ></textarea>
            </label>
            <button type="submit" class="button solid">Send enquiry</button>
            <p class="form-note" id="form-note" role="status"></p>
          </form>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <div class="wrap foot">
        <div class="foot-logo">
          <img src="./imgs/logo-mark.jpg" alt="KGM TLAKS Photography logo" />
